# Custom narrative videos

Before generating or rewriting a YouTube cut, read `docs/custom-videos.md` and the matching page under `docs/videos/`.

- New title → completely new storyline. Never clone the last video’s beat sheet.
- Third-person narrator. Kokoro `am_liam`, not ElevenLabs, not Edge. `NARRATION_WPM=205` for Kokoro.
- Scenes follow each other: locked hero, locked props, match cuts. Fill-frame 16:9. Thumbs are 1280×720 JPEG.
- When a video ships, update `docs/videos/<slug>.md` and `docs/videos/README.md`.
